        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Stig Blomqvist\n- Companies: Audi, Volkswagen Group\n- Products: Audi Quattro\n- Organizations: Audi factory team, World Rally Championship\n- Roles: rally driver\n\nFacts:\n- Stig Blomqvist was born on 29 July 1946.\n- Stig Blomqvist is a Swedish rally driver.\n- The Audi Quattro is a road and rally car produced by Audi, which is part of the Volkswagen Group.\n- Driving an Audi Quattro for the Audi factory team, Stig Blomqvist won the World Rally Championship drivers' title in 1984.\n- Driving an Audi Quattro for the Audi factory team, Stig Blomqvist finished runner-up in the World Rally Championship drivers' standings in 1985.",
